      "displayName": "Vikram (RupeeRail)",
      "type": "HUMAN"
    },
    "createTime": "2026-08-03T11:15:00Z",
    "text": "Yes, during our deploys webhook delivery pauses for up to about 5 minutes, then everything queued is delivered. We retry delivery for 1 hour.",
