  {
    "name": "spaces/infra/messages/84cc0678d46.de190f84ce3",
    "sender": {
      "name": "users/10003",
      "displayName": "Priya Iyer",
      "type": "HUMAN"
    },
    "createTime": "2026-08-26T09:40:00Z",
    "text": "Rotated the RupeeRail API key on staging per the quarterly checklist. Charges work but no webhooks are being processed?",
    "thread": {
      "name": "spaces/infra/threads/84cc0678d46"
    },
    "space": {
      "name": "spaces/infra"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "spaces/infra/messages/84cc0678d46.64dafa91854",
    "sender": {
      "name": "users/10002",
      "displayName": "Arjun Mehta",
      "type": "HUMAN"
    },
    "createTime": "2026-08-26T09:52:00Z",
    "text": "Signature check fails on every webhook. It's buried in their docs: rotating the API key also rotates the webhook signing secret. We still have the old WEBHOOK_SECRET in the k8s secret, so webhooks.py rejects everything and only logs at debug. On prod every payment confirmation would silently fail.",
    "thread": {
      "name": "spaces/infra/threads/84cc0678d46"
    },
    "space": {
      "name": "spaces/infra"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "spaces/infra/messages/84cc0678d46.9ca20387fd6",
    "sender": {
      "name": "users/10003",
      "displayName": "Priya Iyer",
      "type": "HUMAN"
    },
    "createTime": "2026-08-26T10:00:00Z",
    "text": "Yikes. I'll make rotate_secrets.sh update both in one step and refuse to finish until a test webhook verifies.",
    "thread": {
      "name": "spaces/infra/threads/84cc0678d46"
    },
    "space": {
      "name": "spaces/infra"
    }
  },
  {
    "name": "spaces/infra/messages/84cc0678d46.151c4a6d804",
    "sender": {
      "name": "users/10002",
      "displayName": "Arjun Mehta",
      "type": "HUMAN"
    },
    "createTime": "2026-08-26T10:02:00Z",
    "text": "And let's never rotate one without the other.",
    "thread": {
      "name": "spaces/infra/threads/84cc0678d46"
    },
    "space": {
      "name": "spaces/infra"
    }
  },
